{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43589","headline":"游长安诸寺联句 靖恭坊大兴善寺 老松青桐联二十字绝句 · 段成式","name":"游长安诸寺联句 靖恭坊大兴善寺 老松青桐联二十字绝句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有松堪系马，遇鉢更投鍼。\n记得汤师句，高禅助朗吟。\n乘晴入精舍，语默想东林。\n尽是忘机侣，谁惊息影禽。\n一雨微尘尽，支郎许数过。\n方同齅薝卜，不用算多罗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"段成式","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43589.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43589","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}